<title>MALAYSIA: Kedah Cement six-mth net up 98.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Kedah Cement six-mth net up 98.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		52.55	  vs	  26.51</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     12.68	  vs	   9.10</p>
<p>    Turnover		 254.61	  vs	 136.74</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  55.59	  vs	  26.79</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)     5.0	   vs	   3.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Kedah Cement Holdings Bhd. It is involved in making and selling bagged and bulk cement.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
